                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ") is displayed using a fixed-width (i.e., monospaced) font. Monospace text formatting is typically used to represent text shown in computer terminals or code editors (often referred to as a codespan)."
